quiz 3 | What are the three subatomic particles in an atom?
* Protons, neutrons, electrons
o Quarks, gluons, photons
o Protons, electrons, positrons
o Neutrons, neutrinos, electrons
= Protons and neutrons are themselves made of quarks.
